[{"title":"秋夜偶成","author":"范景文","text":"小立虚亭内，远香静可闻。\n伴惟邀冷月，影欲殢凉云。\n伤晚怜秋老，贪清坐夜分。\n深情何所寄，酌酒取微醺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22505,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居用退如韵","author":"范景文","text":"为因谢客掩柴关，明月曾留共往还。\n袪病寻方餐白石，卧游就壁见青山。\n诗成快极思忘苦，梦里灵通睡不顽。\n日课香灯经半卷，殊无别事碍清閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22506,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"周景文年兄过访","author":"范景文","text":"名字同来讵偶然，心期细话夜灯前。\n冲涛故我留还在，咽雪旁人不敢怜。\n笑以相看仍哭世，醉非因酒为忧天。\n京尘知否今如沸，玉尺持将并月悬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22507,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋望","author":"范景文","text":"霜压秋光碎，林容似不胜。\n近山空翠湿，低野远烟凭。\n声咽风中雁，影寒水际僧。\n揽云楼上望，日在最高层。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22508,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"残荷","author":"范景文","text":"雨馀风际费禁持，除却亭亭别有姿。\n偶忆佳人初睡起，销魂正在欲嫣时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22509,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同汪未央王太初尝秋茶","author":"范景文","text":"虚窗菊影印疏斜，拣得山泉共试茶。\n香外微涵岩洞韵，声中小验乳冰花。\n水惟取活频看火，洗不嫌多净去沙。\n似带高秋清冽意，谁誇谷雨剪新芽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22510,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邸报","author":"范景文","text":"邸报愁抛又取看，时常痛哭总无端。\n朝班水火君何利，仕路风波隐亦难。\n病起心犹劳念纬，才庸道只合投竿。\n买山欲问桃源路，何处烟霾不渺漫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22511,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同未央坐绣研斋","author":"范景文","text":"冬足清人意，晴窗亦带寒。\n石灵香聚晕，研绣墨留残。\n披画茶相赏，摘梅雪并餐。\n鉴凭诗格取，商定可能宽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22512,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"范景文","text":"微嫌花气掩，棚下坐焚香。\n竹引人偏远，更催月觉忙。\n茶涛烹古雪，螀韵答清商。\n定起蒲团坐，幽通鹤梦长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22513,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"未央贻余画竹题云倪元镇自谓其画竹如麻如芦犹去竹不远兹画叶乃如树叶殊无一毫似也作此赏之","author":"范景文","text":"不欲全求似，萧森态转真。\n缘风微作势，邀月澹传神。\n叶密留云宿，丛幽借石邻。\n还于匀墨处，高寄想其人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22514,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起","author":"范景文","text":"不为经秋瘦倍前，愁心难理绪纷然。\n虽行泽畔还忧国，每步星前仰问天。\n戒作诗文曾誓墓，閒寻灵梦当游仙。\n病馀?定生涯计，一笠寒云卫水边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22515,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壬戍中秋酌月方罢城西忽报寇警当夜移书请兵于时引烛挥毫与杯酒共为淋漓一段意气不觉自雄偶忆其事诗以记之","author":"范景文","text":"邹峄城边战骨高，血腥染月黯平濠。\n偏当胜日闻传警，不放清尊有佩刀。\n谈笑凭将吞贼垒，缄书飞去代龙韬。\n整閒应愧围棋墅，痛哭筹兵气自豪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22516,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪霁月夜同刘从之斋中尝茶","author":"范景文","text":"见晴先已快，得月更添清。\n雪后寒光彻，庭空晚意生。\n分烟同画看，取影见梅横。\n赛茗增新课，敲冰起自烹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22517,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"姚孟长过访","author":"范景文","text":"夙昔共周旋，生平欣依托。\n冰雪濯肝肠，尘喧不能灼。\n寥寥神味投，别久伤离索。\n闻君自北来，未见意已作。\n片帆驻江干，副兹千里约。\n夜雨对深灯，清言纷如错。\n茫茫百感生，欲语喉间格。\n中有不能平，时托于谐谑。\n举国坐漏舟，危楫焉所泊。\n凭君济代人，余将安丘壑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22518,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"看雪","author":"范景文","text":"看雪生閒恨，如花但少香。\n窗明临薄月，云湿动虚光。\n情与听泉近，景因带竹凉。\n空庭迷素影，一鹤自轩翔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22519,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘耳枝过访","author":"范景文","text":"久别方思已到门，霜棱满面气清温。\n春新酌酒催花节，月过张灯补上元。\n非马谭奇堪洗耳，如莺度曲欲销魂。\n披来醉墨神飞动，撼壁云涛夜色翻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22520,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花朝雨","author":"范景文","text":"拈得花朝字，无花亦自怜。\n移情听夜雨，借景看云烟。\n霁赏期明日，芳游忆去年。\n一杯春水绿，携上泛湖船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22521,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏夜同李仲昌小坐阅邢子愿书","author":"范景文","text":"新晴夏夜亦萧森，杯酒寻常觉独深。\n花为殿春犹恋草，树当趁月上栖禽。\n笔锋入处看偏正，诗案翻来辨古今。\n久坐一庭空似水，无言相对领元心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22522,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夜流云阁听客弹琴","author":"范景文","text":"何事三春里，泠然一片秋。\n酒虽留客醉，琴故使人幽。\n茶熟香销鼎，灯残月到楼。\n馀将萧飒意，入梦作仙游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22523,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓起","author":"范景文","text":"残月晨光认未明，薰炉贴被晓烟清。\n因贪好梦常思睡，任带馀酣懒解酲。\n觉半犹嫌惊帐蝶，起来预拟听林莺。\n恐虚客约看花早，欹枕呼童问雨晴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22524,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春暮看迎春花","author":"范景文","text":"春深方欲去，花始见迎春。\n避雪迟芳候，攀条怅美人。\n分黄邀柳伴，惬赏得茶新。\n持此留将送，相怜意更真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22525,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三月廿七日来道之将归会稽送之桑园别墅","author":"范景文","text":"剪烛为欢夜雨前，易州酒媚越归船。\n赏花限展还三日，瀹茗瓶开第一泉。\n稍歇吹弹因说剑，不妨谐谑亦参禅。\n怕闻人与春俱去，起拂离歌奏别弦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22526,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅雨","author":"范景文","text":"听雨原清课，虽多不厌赊。\n就檐深贮水，近火谩供茶。\n醉日堪移竹，閒时省浣花。\n游情还未碍，蜡屐过山家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22527,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赏新茶","author":"范景文","text":"千钱市茗止争先，才过清明寄自燕。\n箬叶重封来马上，乳花细沸试铛前。\n严亲只饮湖州水，座客还吟顾渚篇。\n为语兹非官橐物，山泉亦附估人船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22528,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒岳有祷","author":"范景文","text":"礼罢名香手自焚，中怀一点彻苍雯。\n帝阍欲叩凭灵岳，玉女为烦启秘文。\n鉴在人天应不远，龄惟父子可相分。\n回身越观峰头望，烟里先看岘岭云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22529,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过泉林得灵字 其一","author":"范景文","text":"尘路何缘泼面醒，寻泉独上玉淙亭。\n澜翻云片吹寒绿，石浸苔花荡古青。\n景欲并幽延月看，时当绝胜趁秋听。\n枕流便就林间卧，耳畔潺潺梦亦灵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22530,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过泉林得灵字 其二","author":"范景文","text":"从来第一数中泠，洗笔题为品水亭。\n山有专名兼字慧，石因漱润可云醒。\n响传濑底同人语，涛沸铛中作雨听。\n好摘蒙嵓花叶煮，茶香泉味总通灵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22531,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过泉林得灵字 其三","author":"范景文","text":"风閒夜静几曾停，百道珍珠泻玉瓶。\n溅去潭光铺软碧，招来山色印空青。\n遥闻互答添松韵，细问深源注水经。\n妄意飞来峰点缀，一缄书报与山灵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22532,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渡江","author":"范景文","text":"瓜洲对峙玉嵯峨，指是金山十里过。\n著眼云容当夏异，撩人风物过江多。\n游情剩得收烟雨，诗料分将与月萝。\n稳记船经阊市下，方言细听谱吴歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22533,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中","author":"范景文","text":"乘风枕上听潺湲，行尽荷塘载月还。\n胜事湖中平占断，推窗便可看晴山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22534,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蕉雨轩尝水","author":"范景文","text":"片片岘山云，朝来看起止。\n此外一事无，睡足惟品水。\n中泠以意寻，想像江心底。\n慧称第二泉，远汲尘易滓。\n何如碧苕溪，潺潺来城里。\n入目快平远，挹之清且美。\n便泼洞山芽，雪花泛冰蕊。\n泉味与茶香，相和有妙理。\n细嚼润枯喉，泉脉湿灵肺。\n白石点作汤，并以砺吾齿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22535,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿昭庆寺晓起","author":"范景文","text":"人境何曾隔，宿来似远山。\n水喧摇画壁，月静隐禅关。\n钟晓人催醒，铃清鸟共閒。\n仍牵馀梦去，稳棹卧湖间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22536,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游玉泉寺观鱼","author":"范景文","text":"湖阴曲曲路还通，绀殿门环四面峰。\n寺寂空山灵在磬，鸟鸣远树响传风。\n妙明佛性潭相印，禅定僧容鹤与同。\n凭阁下看吹锦浪，游鱼影带夕霞红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22537,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖上夜作","author":"范景文","text":"游情入静始相关，歌管虽清亦暂删。\n乘月遍寻湖上寺，披烟细认雨中山。\n荷风散水香初冷，岚气吹云晚渐閒。\n幽赏仍须人共领，听钟坐待老僧还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22538,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灵隐寺","author":"范景文","text":"寺涵灵气隐山椒，不待登楼月可招。\n觅径穿云行屡歇，谈经拂石坐相邀。\n洞深雨积当晴湿，泉窦风吹入夜嚣。\n门对飞来峰绝胜，何须极目瞰江潮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22539,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖上晚归","author":"范景文","text":"登山泛水两相宜，船后轻舆更使随。\n一径晴岚深见寺，千寻悬瀑下通陂。\n鸟迷树影归林乱，云恋湖阴入岫迟。\n欲向空潭延月色，穿桥夜坐放生池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22540,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"招戏设席于吴门舟上晚泊虎丘","author":"范景文","text":"歌板初传酒渐催，金阊桥下放船开。\n香风低散飘罗袂，艳舞轻翻簇锦堆。\n渔唱依林吹笛和，莲舟拂水送花来。\n当场已自销魂甚，莫近生公说法台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22541,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上晚行","author":"范景文","text":"江行何必月，水气自难暝。\n浪涌潮头白，云拖雨脚青。\n帆樯过鸟影，渔火动龙灵。\n坐起清神魄，涛声作瀑听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22542,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过江抵维扬","author":"范景文","text":"广陵涛起涨秋间，一棹乘潮夜抵关。\n行李累人因载水，邮符借得好看山。\n江乡欲别仍回首，吴唾重听少破颜。\n惟有兰苕溪上月，领将一路伴人还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22543,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早发","author":"范景文","text":"归途贪看月，带睡促宵征。\n旅梦风吹断，客心雁过惊。\n路穷常遇水，云散渐临城。\n晓气清如此，连朝雨乍晴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22544,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将抵家见月","author":"范景文","text":"客里三逢月，西湖一载游。\n暑因清渐减，劳得快相酬。\n低照从山起，馀情借雨收。\n归家看亦好，尅日到中秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22545,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其一","author":"范景文","text":"层层柳色水平池，三里孤城月照陴。\n山雨楼空钟罢响，开门忙杀卖糕儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22546,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其二","author":"范景文","text":"龙潭月冷澹无波，自昔瀛州带九河。\n北望燕京南接赵，土人犹说古悲歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22547,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其三","author":"范景文","text":"钩盘击浪注东来，风捲蹄轮碾作埃。\n搔首筑堤人不见，最高传自祭风台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22548,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其四","author":"范景文","text":"野旷烟平写意图，垂杨深处隐城隅。\n月明桥断吴家渡，古井风吹响辘轳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22549,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其五","author":"范景文","text":"石马寒嘶卧古松，地老幽魂向此中。\n穷杀城南耕瘠土，年年冢畔哭秋风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22550,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其六","author":"范景文","text":"秋水蒹葭绿雨敷，冷香亭外碧澄湖。\n画船泛月人争看，道是潇湘好画图。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22551,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其七","author":"范景文","text":"元宵踏月月如银，士子焚香拜圣人。\n道遇女郎走百病，南关灯火一时新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22552,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其八","author":"范景文","text":"春来多半是风沙，雨后新晴一抹霞。\n梨白桃红杨柳绿，蘋婆花似海棠花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22553,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其九","author":"范景文","text":"芳郊走马踏青行，随意空城春草生。\n绿柳阴中鞦韆影，游人知道是清明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22554,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其十","author":"范景文","text":"雨当三月贵如金，夜望云生早看阴。\n风刮土龙鳞爪动，杨枝洒水叫甘霖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22555,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其十一","author":"范景文","text":"春锄带雨润如酥，风送农歌动地呼。\n怕说城中飞檄至，修堤河上点丁夫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22556,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其十二","author":"范景文","text":"连窝驿枕卫河隈，乘传何堪前站催。\n白米江鱼随处有，麦黄水涨送船来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22557,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其十三","author":"范景文","text":"凤仙浸指甲尖绯，架上石榴簇作围。\n茉莉南船新寄到，百钱买得一盆归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22558,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其十四","author":"范景文","text":"春饥指望到秋偿，未老新蚕已典桑。\n风刈雨锄浑旧事，如今岁岁打飞蝗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22559,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其十五","author":"范景文","text":"菜香瓜熟枣离离，正是田家快活时。\n官苦徵逋私苦债，隔邻含泣卖妻儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22560,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其十六","author":"范景文","text":"屋破村荒照月明，寒灯络纬夜三更。\n机杼声残眠未稳，唤起男儿事早耕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22561,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其十七","author":"范景文","text":"家家酿酒泛黄花，初熟携将问狭邪。\n一曲新声听不了，留眠过夜醉琵琶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22562,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其十八","author":"范景文","text":"蓟北雪飞十月天，孤村云冻破炊烟。\n风酸路滑行人绝，犹见老僧驴背眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22563,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其十九","author":"范景文","text":"桃符门挂映春联，爆竹声中又一年。\n队队轻衫香笼袖，斗鸡日费几千钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22564,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其二十","author":"范景文","text":"白衣赛会竞烧香，簇拥如花看道场。\n小扇频遮移步缓，旁边立住少年郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22565,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其二十一","author":"范景文","text":"闻催新饷倍生愁，岁岁加编未得休。\n一邑硝黄三十万，出关重复派车牛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22566,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其二十二","author":"范景文","text":"黍稷才收便摘花，一年最苦是农家。\n霜来九月秋原尽，又见风吹麦陇斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22567,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其二十三","author":"范景文","text":"十家九尽垫官钱，敲扑声高欲彻天。\n昨日相逢开口笑，徭差新改一条鞭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22568,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其二十四","author":"范景文","text":"阔袖高冠士气驯，从来文事亦彬彬。\n近科只说丙午盛，十五人中举六人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22569,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其二十五","author":"范景文","text":"乡里儿郎也解歌，时兴曲子土音哦。\n最难听是声哀急，不为关情唤奈何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22570,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其二十六","author":"范景文","text":"青丝斜纽挽双鬟，斗草才同姊妹还。\n闻说郎来亲插戴，背人偷觑倚窗间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22571,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其二十七","author":"范景文","text":"北吴原不是东吴，古意如今问有无。\n击筑馀风劳想像，一时俗尚喜言苏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22572,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其二十八","author":"范景文","text":"红亭带柳板桥横，古道西郊送客行。\n谩道征轮怜下国，彤云咫尺望神京。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22573,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和北吴歌 其二十九","author":"范景文","text":"齐讴变调和初成，一字吟来一字情。\n便带虎丘山下去，船回月上试新声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22574,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]